  "prefLabel": "Ins 3601.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 3601.01 Purpose. The purpose of this rule is to implement RSA 415-D, to promote the public interest, to promote the availability of long-term care insurance coverage, to protect applicants for long-term care insurance, as defined, from unfair or deceptive sales or enrollment practices, to facilitate public understanding and comparison of long-term care insurance coverages, and to facilitate flexibility and innovation in the development of long-term care insurance.\n\nSource. #8036, eff 5-1-04; ss by #10154, eff 6-25-12; ss by #13400, eff 6-22-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins3600.html"
}
